<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109263" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποστύφω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[στῡ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be somewhat astringent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.118
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποστῦφον ἥδυσμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			; of astringent tastes, <i>screw up</i> the mouth, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>treat</i> a part <i>with an astringent,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνῳ</span>
			v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				106
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>make astringent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρωμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Od.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>thicken somewhat,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἔλαιον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
